  "label": "Jack Nicholson's portrayals of mental health",
  "description": "Jack Nicholson has portrayed characters with mental health conditions in several films, most notably in 'One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest' as Randle P. McMurphy, a rebellious patient in a psychiatric hospital. His performance in this film is iconic and has contributed to his public image as an actor who can portray complex psychological states. The meme leverages this association to create a juxtaposition between his cheerful demeanor and the text about mental illness.",
